# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day24

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| alter | 변경하다 | Climate change may alter ecosystems. |
| significant | 중요한, 상당한 | The study found a significant difference. |
| obtain | 얻다, 획득하다 | Researchers obtained new data. |

---

## Synonyms

### alter
→ change / modify

### significant
→ important / considerable

### obtain
→ acquire / get

---

## Useful Collocations

alter the environment
→ 환경을 변화시키다

significant difference
→ 상당한 차이

obtain information
→ 정보를 얻다

